&lt;/figure&gt;</description></item><item><title>KERISE v1の回路設計</title><link>https://www.kerislab.jp/posts/2016-12-27-kerisev1/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Dec 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.kerislab.jp/posts/2016-12-27-kerisev1/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="概要"&gt;概要&lt;/h2&gt;
